          <attvalue for="28" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.85" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Changes in physical energy flows (notably Russian diesel/crude exports and pipeline deliveries) directly alter volumes available for commercial and strategic storage, so a drop in flows reduces global diesel stocks and a restoration raises them." />
