          <attvalue for="28" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="An increase in net physical energy commodity flows into global markets eases supply tightness and reduces the spot risk premium, putting downward pressure on benchmark oil prices (and vice versa for flow reductions)." />
