          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Prolonged hardware and component bottlenecks force governments to provide subsidies, emergency procurement and industrial support (or to tolerate revenue shortfalls from slower growth), which widens deficits and raises sovereign fiscal stress." />
