          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.55" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Severe bottlenecks in critical components (electronics, control systems) for shipyards and repair yards delay tanker deliveries and maintenance cycles, temporarily lowering effective tanker availability for crude and product movements." />
